src/a.py:2:8-9: `os` imported but unused (F401)
src/a.py:12:1-5: `print` found (T201)
src/bad.py:1:7: Expected a parameter or the end of the parameter list (invalid-syntax)
src/bad.py:2:1: unexpected EOF while parsing (invalid-syntax)
